After reading the csharp code provided, the assert statement corresponds to the comment "@@@ index is either -1 or greater than or equal to 2". 

The assert statement is `Debug.Assert(index == -1 || index >= 2);`. This statement checks if the value of `index` is either -1 or greater than or equal to 2. If the condition is true, the program execution continues. If the condition is false, a runtime exception will be thrown, indicating that an assertion failed. This indicates that the assertion is checking the return value of the `Search` function from the `ArrayList` class.--------------------
